Subject: [PATCH] KosmicKrisp 2026-04-17 to 2026-07-07
asahi,nir: Move asahi dynamic clipz pass to common.
vulkan: add tracking for VK_EXT_primitive_restart_index
poly: Fix range used for index unroll bounds checks
poly: Refactor poly_unroll_restart for general purpose unrolling
kk: Pre-declare texture SSA variables
kk: Fix flrp signed-zero preservation with float_controls2
kk: Record command buffers live and replay only on resubmit
kk: Implement VK_KHR_dynamic_rendering_local_read
kk: defer cmd buffer submission and lighten compute barriers
kk: refold combined image/sampler packing after vars_to_ssa
kk: Expose texture max dimensions based on GPU family
kk: Reduce root buffer pointer by replacing it with the GPU address
kk: Disable workarounds 1-6 in macOS 27
kk: Add GPU hang detection
kk: Work around Metal index robustness gaps
kk: Implement draw-related commands using device addresses
kk: Move to Metal4 command encoding
kk: Respect precomp-compiler options when setting up kk_clc
kk,wsi/metal: Support VK_(KHR/EXT)_swapchain_maintenance1
kk,wsi/metal: Support VK_EXT_hdr_metadata
kk: Work around crash with multiple concurrent MTL4Compiler
kk: Migrate to Metal 4 pipelines
kk: Enable shaderTessellationAndGeometryPointSize
kk: Ensure some vertex lowerings happen on hardware stage
kk: Remove unused deprecated Metal APIs
kk: Clean up per draw upload for tessellation stage
kk: Move poly data out of root buffer
kk: Use subgroups for tessellation prefix count since they are now fixed
kk: Use index element size instead of Metal enum to avoid asserts
kk: Support VK_EXT_sample_locations
kk: Fix divide by 0 in non-indexed draw unroll
kk: Do not force render image view to all subresources
kk: Perform sink-and-move of instructions
kk: Advertise additional tessellation dynamic state
kk: Support VK_EXT_external_memory_host
kk: Implement tessellation
kk: Rework shader compilation to handle more than 2 stages
kk: Rework draw dispatch
kk: Support VK_IMAGE_CREATE_BLOCK_TEXEL_VIEW_COMPATIBLE_BIT
kk: Fence read-write images after write
kk: Support VK_EXT_primitive_topology_list_restart
kk: Support VK_EXT_primitive_restart_index
kk: Support VK_EXT_custom_resolve
kk: Support VK_EXT_blend_operation_advanced
kk: Support VK_EXT_vertex_attribute_robustness
kk: Accurately declare supported samples in image format properties
kk: Handle index robustness for fully bound buffers manually
kk: Do not use image-to-image copies for 1D compressed textures
kk: Sanitize image copy through buffer extents
kk: Fix precomp data buffer alignment
kk: Correctly report failures when compiling precompiled shaders
kk: Add grid struct for dispatches for convenience
kk: Rewrite force position output pass to use lowered io
kk: Fix global_store writemask
kk: Support VK_EXT_conditional_rendering
kk: Enable VK_EXT_nested_command_buffer
kk: Refactor multi-draws and predicates into kk_draw_data
kk: Support VK_KHR_shader_untyped_pointers
kk: De-duplicate geometry unroll logic
kk: Fix compute system value and algebric lowering in pre-compiles
kk: Enable code formatting enforcement
kk: Fix pre-compiled compute grid size
kk: Allocate temporary command memory from pool
kk: Fix some missed NIR debug asserts
kk: Support VK_KHR_unified_image_layouts
kk: Support attachment feedback loop extensions
kk: Support VK_KHR_shader_fma
kk: Support VK_EXT_host_image_copy
kk: Separate linear and GPU optimized image layout properties
kk: Enable maintenance extensions through VK_KHR_maintenance10
kk: Support new query pool and dynamic rendering flags
kk: Fix image copies for depth/stencil<->color and differing subresources
kk: Support device without queue
kk: Disable A8_UNORM format
kk: Handle accurate OpSMod and default point size requirements
kk: Implement index buffer robustness for BindIndexBuffer2
kk: Create image layout from vk_image
kk: Fix subgroup failures on M1/2 due to bcsel
kk: Complete VK_EXT_memory_budget
kk: Query device for supported sample counts
kk: Support shaderCullDistance
kk: Enable VK_(EXT/KHR)_line_rasterization
kk: Enable VK_(EXT/KHR)_robustness2 and VK_EXT_pipeline_robustness
kk: Support nullDescriptor
kk: Support robustBufferAccess2
kk: Support VK_EXT_post_depth_coverage
kk: Fix handling of sample mask and sample rate shading
kk: Split per-draw data to separate binding
kk: Enable VK_EXT_multi_draw
kk: Support VK_(KHR/EXT)_index_type_uint8
kk: Fix geometry unroll for list primitives.
kk: Enable remaining subgroup operations
kk: Support subgroup rotate ops
kk: Fix emitting negative infinity
kk: Expand workaround 3 to cover general use of ballot/vote ops
kk: Workaround for GPU capture under Rosetta 2.
kk: Enable VK_(EXT/KHR)_global_priority and VK_EXT_global_priority_query
kk: Enable VK_EXT_buffer_device_address
kk: Enable VK_EXT_extended_dynamic_state3
kk: Fix issues with maximal reconvergence
kk: Add support for VK_EXT_depth_clip_control.
kk: Fix VK_CULL_MODE_FRONT_AND_BACK with points and lines.
kk: Add type inference for additional built-in intrinsics.
kk: Add ds state to fragment key since it's part of the pipeline we compile
kk: Update dynamic depth stencil state regardless of set attachments.
kk: Enable VK_AMD_shader_image_load_store_lod
kk: Use device limits for buffers and compute shared memory.
kk: Increase maxFragmentCombinedOutputResources to KK_MAX_DESCRIPTORS
kk: Reuse as much poly utilities as possible for unrolling
kk: Add poly dependency to KK
